  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/T4xFVm8kct\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_88829ca5-d813-4ded-b021-30cf3a70da2c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"104\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fatii1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_5d0091c0-57d5-4bc5-8592-ca850b88254c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"102\"></a><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308486/description_9a094285-8843-43a7-91fd-7131c5d03d7f.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"><br>本模组完全替换并重做了基于中世纪建筑风格的广袤城市与城镇，覆盖村庄。全部仅使用原版特性，即<strong>不包含任何自定义方块或实体</strong>。<strong>(自由添加到任何整合包中)</strong><br><br>推荐用来解决卡顿的模组：</strong><br>Enhanced Block Entities<br>ImmediatelyFast<br>Sodium<br>Entity Culling<br>FerriteCore<br>Chunky</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308486/description_a175c332-b1a6-4770-a551-0d55892bfc78.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p>\n<p><strong>最近更新：</strong><br>支持 1.21.11<br>改善刷怪机制<br>增加对向村庄添加结构的模组的兼容<br><br>🆕 <strong>5 个中的 3 个已重做：</strong><br>✅ 平原村庄<br>✅ 针叶林村庄<br>✅ 雪原村庄<br>🟧 热带草原村庄<br>🟧 沙漠村庄</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308486/description_9c6b75dd-54e6-4c40-8254-c1b2562948e8.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p>\n<p>正在开发中的模组列表：</p>\n<p>✅ Epic Villages<br>✅ Epic Witch huts<br>✅ Epic Dungeons<br>✅ Epic Igloos&nbsp;<br>🟨 Epic Jungle Temples</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308486/description_3af40383-8222-4dc8-9b26-ea8587d2054f.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p>\n<p><strong>- ✅ </strong>与<strong> 几乎所有生成模组兼容<br></strong><strong>- ✅&nbsp;</strong>与<strong> ChoiceTheorem's Overhauled Village 完全兼容<br></strong><strong>- ✅ </strong>与<strong>Guard </strong><strong>Villagers完全兼容<br></strong><strong>- ✅ </strong>与<strong>Waystones&nbsp;完全兼容<br></strong><br>- <strong>🚧 与其他村庄重做模组同时使用时可能导致问题</strong><br><br><br></p>",
